  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  @  LogisAll
  @  Everything about one point, tagged: CDF, PDF, CDFc, mean, deviation.
  @  Author & design          : Jean Wilson
  @  Co-authors & programming  : Claude & Claude Code (Anthropic)
  @  Arguments may be given loose or bundled in a list of 3; that list is
  @  what LastArguments reports, and its length is checked before use.
  @ ------------------------------------------------------------
  IF DUP TypeName "list" == THEN IF DUP Size 3 ≠ THEN "LogisAll: needs 3 arguments" DoError END Explode Drop END
  → μv sv Xv « μv 0 + sv 0 + Xv 0 + → μ s X « '1/(1+EXP(-(X-μ)/s))' →Num 'Kc' STO Kc "CDF" →Tag 'EXP(-(X-μ)/s)/(s*((1+EXP(-(X-μ)/s))^2))' →Num "PDF" →Tag '1/(1+EXP((X-μ)/s))' →Num "CDFc" →Tag 'μ' →Num "μ" →Tag 's*Ⓒπ/√(3)' →Num "sx" →Tag { Kc } PURGE μv sv Xv 3 →List Drop » »
